<div class="landing-page">
    <section class="landing-hero super-sect">
        <div class="landing-hero-copy">
            <p class="landing-eyebrow">
                <span class="icon icon-[lucide--messages-square]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                For teams and content makers
            </p>
            <h1>Where teams work and communities grow.</h1>
            <p class="landing-lede">
                Draqun is building a connected home for internal communication
                and the communities content makers create around their work.
            </p>
            <div class="landing-actions">
                <a href="/chat" class="btn btn-primary">
                    Open {{.AppName}}
                    <span class="icon icon-[lucide--arrow-up-right] size-4" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="landing-audiences super-sect">
        <div class="landing-section-heading">
            <p class="landing-eyebrow">Two places to start</p>
            <h2>Built around the way people work and create.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="landing-audience-grid">
            <article class="landing-audience">
                <p class="landing-audience-index">01 / INTERNAL COMMUNICATIONS</p>
                <h3>Keep the work close to the conversation.</h3>
                <p>
                    Give teams a shared space for everyday discussion, decisions,
                    and the projects that move forward through them.
                </p>
                <p class="landing-audience-direction">
                    The direction: connect team chat with project tracking,
                    shared knowledge, and meetings.
                </p>
            </article>
            <article class="landing-audience">
                <p class="landing-audience-index">02 / CONTENT MAKERS</p>
                <h3>Bring your community around what you make.</h3>
                <p>
                    Create a place where your audience can find each other,
                    follow your work, and be part of the conversation.
                </p>
                <p class="landing-audience-direction">
                    The direction: bring community, publishing, live moments,
                    and media closer together.
                </p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="landing-vision super-sect">
        <div class="landing-vision-copy">
            <p class="landing-eyebrow">A modular everything app</p>
            <h2>Not a pile of separate apps. One place where things connect.</h2>
            <p>
                A conversation can lead to a plan. A team space can hold the
                knowledge behind the work. A creator's community can gather
                around a new release or live event.
            </p>
        </div>
        <ol class="landing-vision-flow" aria-label="How Draqun's modules connect">
            <li>
                <span class="landing-vision-number">01</span>
                <span>
                    <strong>Talk</strong>
                    <span>People and groups connect.</span>
                </span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="landing-vision-number">02</span>
                <span>
                    <strong>Make</strong>
                    <span>Work and ideas move forward.</span>
                </span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="landing-vision-number">03</span>
                <span>
                    <strong>Share</strong>
                    <span>Communities grow around what matters.</span>
                </span>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="landing-foundation super-sect">
        <p class="landing-eyebrow">Where it begins</p>
        <h2>Group chat is the first step.</h2>
        <p>
            Draqun is in active development. Today, start with group conversations,
            public communities, and private groups—then follow along as the
            platform grows.
        </p>
        <a href="/chat" class="btn btn-primary">
            Open {{.AppName}}
            <span class="icon icon-[lucide--arrow-up-right] size-4" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </a>
    </section>
</div>
